<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS2.SSS0.Px3" title="In D.2 Depends (conditional reducibility) or Outside ℛ ‣ Appendix D Normal Form Gallery ‣ Opal: An Operator Algebra View of RLHF" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Score-dependent weighting.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS2.SSS0.Px4" title="In D.2 Depends (conditional reducibility) or Outside ℛ ‣ Appendix D Normal Form Gallery ‣ Opal: An Operator Algebra View of RLHF" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Gated penalties.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
