<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A8.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix H Operational Validation of the Algebra ‣ Opal: An Operator Algebra View of RLHF" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Controls and reporting.</span></a></li>
